BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//WorkBuddy//Game Version Calendar//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Endfield - Version Calendar
X-WR-CALDESC:Only Arknights: Endfield previews and version updates. Leaving
  a game? On iPhone just delete that calendar. On Android\, switch OFF "sho
 w" in Calendar account settings instead of tapping Delete - deleting one U
 RL subscription removes all of them.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:endfield-17-preview@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261117T113000Z
DTEND:20261117T130000Z
SUMMARY:Arknights: Endfield 1.7 Special Program (Estimated)
DESCRIPTION:The 1.6 program aired 9 days before launch (a Tuesday)\, so thi
 s follows the same pattern. Preview rewards now have to be claimed on the 
 event site - they are no longer mailed.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC
 +8).\nEntries marked Estimated or TBC are projected from version cycles an
 d may shift once officially announced.
LOCATION:Arknights: Endfield - Official stream
CATEGORIES:Arknights: Endfield
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Special Program starts in 30 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
